        "original_id": "4e783eb4-550d-59c0-88b1-265e81219c91",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Koyaanisqatsi, Mad Hot Ballroom, Powaqqatsi\n- People: Godfrey Reggio, Philip Glass, Ron Fricke, Marilyn Agrelo, Amy Sewell\n- Organizations: New York City Department of Education\n- Concepts: experimental film, documentary film, ballroom dance program, sequel\n\nFacts:\n- Koyaanisqatsi, also known as Koyaanisqatsi: Life Out of Balance, is a 1982 American experimental film.\n- Koyaanisqatsi was directed by Godfrey Reggio, with music composed by Philip Glass and cinematography by Ron Fricke.\n- Powaqqatsi, also known as Powaqqatsi: Life in Transformation, is a 1988 American documentary film directed by Godfrey Reggio.\n- Powaqqatsi is the sequel to Godfrey Reggio's 1982 experimental film Koyaanisqatsi.\n- Mad Hot Ballroom is a 2005 American documentary film directed and co-produced by Marilyn Agrelo and written and co-produced by Amy Sewell.\n- Mad Hot Ballroom is about a ballroom dance program in the New York City Department of Education for fifth graders in the New York City public school system.",
